OL,3,GNEWSASouth falls silent to mark
OL,4,AArmistice Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople across the South have observed a
OL,7,Ftwo-minute silence to mark Armistice
OL,8,FDay.
OL,10,FCeremonies were held in towns and
OL,11,Fcities including Reading, Oxford,
OL,12,FSouthampton, Basingstoke and Wimborne
OL,13,FMinster on Wednesday.
OL,15,FThe silence at 11:00 GMT marks the
OL,16,Fmoment fighting stopped on the Western
OL,17,FFront at the end of World War One in
OL,18,F1918.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
