OL,3,GNEWSASouth falls silent to mark
OL,4,AArmistice Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeterans, cadets, civic leaders and
OL,7,Fmembers of the public came together to
OL,8,Fremember those who died in both world
OL,9,Fwars, as well as subsequent conflicts.
